<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --font-family: "<%= (session && session.fontStyle ? String(session.fontStyle).trim() : 'Inter') %>", sans-serif;
        --primary: #01535b;
        --primary-light: #e8f4f5;
        --border: #e5e7eb;
        --text: #1f2937;
        --text-muted: #6b7280;
        --bg: #f9fafb;
      }

      body {
        font-family: var(--font-family);
        color: var(--text);
        margin: 0;
        background-color: var(--bg);
        line-height: 1.6;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

      main {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 100px 24px 60px;
      }

      .page-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }

      .page-header h1 {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
      }

      .page-header p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .help-info {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .help-info p {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .help-info p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

      .help-info a {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .help-info a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

      .help-links {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .help-link-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 16px;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--text);
        transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      }

      .help-link-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--primary);
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(1, 83, 91, 0.08);
      }

      .help-link-card svg {
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto 8px;
        color: var(--primary);
      }

      .help-link-card span {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      form {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 28px 24px;
      }

      .form-title {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--primary);
        margin: 0 0 20px;
      }

      .form-group {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .form-group label {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .form-group input,
      .form-group textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-family: var(--font-family);
        background: var(--bg);
        transition: border-color 0.2s;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .form-group input:focus,
      .form-group textarea:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--primary);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(1, 83, 91, 0.08);
      }

      .form-group textarea {
        resize: vertical;
        min-height: 100px;
      }

      button[type="submit"] {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 12px;
        background: var(--primary);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-family: var(--font-family);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }

      button[type="submit"]:hover {
        background: #014048;
      }

      button[type="submit"]:focus {
        outline: none;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(1, 83, 91, 0.2);
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        main { padding: 24px 16px 40px; }
        .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
        form { padding: 20px 18px; }
        .help-info { padding: 18px; }
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        main { padding: 20px 14px 32px; }
        .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
        .page-header p { font-size: 0.88rem; }
        .help-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
        .help-link-card { padding: 14px; }
        .help-link-card span { font-size: 0.85rem; }
        form { padding: 16px 14px; }
        .form-title { font-size: 1rem; }
        .form-group label { font-size: 0.88rem; }
        .form-group input,
        .form-group textarea { font-size: 16px; padding: 10px 12px; }
        .help-info { padding: 14px; }
        .help-info p { font-size: 0.9rem; }
        button[type="submit"] { font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 12px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>

    <main>
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1>Get Help</h1>
        <p>We're here to help you get the most out of Managira</p>
      </div>

      <%- include('../partials/flash') %>

      <div class="help-links">
        <a href="/legal/faq" class="help-link-card">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
          <span>FAQ</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@managira" target="_blank" class="help-link-card">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
          <span>Video Tutorials</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="help-info">
        <p>Before submitting a request, check our <a href="/legal/faq">FAQ page</a> for quick answers to common questions about registration, billing, student management, and more.</p>
        <p>For urgent matters, you can also email us directly at <strong>support@managira.com</strong></p>
      </div>

      <form action="/legal/help" method="POST">
        <p class="form-title">Submit a Support Request</p>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Full Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="organization">Organisation (optional)</label>
          <input type="text" id="organization" name="organization" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Which school or organisation?" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
          <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+1 (555) 123-4567" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="your@email.com" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">How can we help?</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required placeholder="Please describe your issue or question in detail..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit">Submit Request</button>
      </form>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>